                "loc": "MAT.22.2+MAT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 22:2–3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ye malaika achiniamba, “Andika maneno higa: Baha aho arioalikpwa yo sharee ya arusi ya ye Mwana ngʼondzi.” Tsona achiniamba, “Higa nchigogomba ni maneno ga kpweli ga Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nádzibwaga chimabumabu maguluni pha yuya malaika ili nimuabudu, ela achiniamba, “Usihende hivyo bii! Mimi nami ni mtumishi dza uwe phamwenga na nduguzo amshuhudiyao Jesu. Uwe muabudu Mlungu bahi! Mana ushaidi wa Jesu ndio chandzo cha unabii wa chiroho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
