            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.17+EZK.39.18+EZK.39.19+EZK.39.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezekieli 39:17–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chisha nchiona malaika aimire dzulu ya dzuwa. Malaika hiye wakota kululu achiiha nderi osi arukao dzulu, achiamba, “Ndzoni mwedze murye karamu kulu ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndzoni mwedze murye nyama za afalume, za akulu a viha, za atu a mkpwotse, nyama za farasi na apandadzi-farasi, nyama za atu osi, atumwa na ario huru, asiokala na vyeo na ario na vyeo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchiona ro dzinyama na afalume a dunia na majeshi gao achikusanyika phamwenga. Aho alonda kupigana na ye ariyekala asegere dzulu ya farasi phamwenga na jeshire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1+REV.13.2+REV.13.3+REV.13.4+REV.13.5+REV.13.6+REV.13.7+REV.13.8+REV.13.9+REV.13.10+REV.13.11+REV.13.12+REV.13.13+REV.13.14+REV.13.15+REV.13.16+REV.13.17+REV.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 13:1–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela dzinyama, phamwenga na nabiiwe wa handzo ariyehenda vilinje kpwa sababuye, ahalwa mateka. Nabii hiye wachenga hinyo okala akatiywa mola wa hiro dzinyama na kuabudu chizukache kpwa kuhenda vilinje. Osi airi atsuphiwa azima ziya ra moho mkali sana wa chibiriti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye mutu yekala asegere dzulu ya farasi, wahumira upangawe utulukao kula kanwani kuolagira majeshi garigosala. Na nyo nderi achirya zo nyama hata achisinywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
